@startuml
title Link User to Restaurant - Fluxo Principal

actor Client

participant UserRestaurantController
participant LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase
participant UserGateway
participant RestaurantGateway
participant UserTypeGateway
participant User
participant Restaurant
participant UserType
database MongoDB

Client -> UserRestaurantController : POST /users/{userId}/restaurants\nLinkUserToRestaurantRequestPayload
UserRestaurantController -> LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase : execute(userId, LinkUserToRestaurantDTO)

LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase -> UserGateway : findById(userId)
UserGateway -> MongoDB : find user
MongoDB --> UserGateway : UserDocument
UserGateway --> LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase : User

LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase -> RestaurantGateway : findById(restaurantId)
RestaurantGateway -> MongoDB : find restaurant
MongoDB --> RestaurantGateway : RestaurantDocument
RestaurantGateway --> LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase : Restaurant

LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase -> UserTypeGateway : findById(userTypeId)
UserTypeGateway -> MongoDB : find userType
MongoDB --> UserTypeGateway : UserTypeDocument
UserTypeGateway --> LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase : UserType

LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase -> UserType : isRestaurantRelated()

alt Tipo de usuário não relacionado a restaurante
    LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase -> LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase : throw BusinessRuleViolationException
end

LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase -> User : isLinkedToRestaurant(restaurantId)

alt Usuário já vinculado ao restaurante
    LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase -> LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase : throw BusinessRuleViolationException
end

LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase -> User : addRestaurant(UserRestaurant)
LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase -> UserGateway : save(User)
UserGateway -> MongoDB : update user
MongoDB --> UserGateway : UserDocument
UserGateway --> LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase : User

LinkUserToRestaurantUseCase --> UserRestaurantController : UserRestaurantResultDTO
UserRestaurantController --> Client : 201 CREATED\nUserRestaurantResponsePayload

@enduml
